# Host-level 301 for judeforall.com is in functions/_middleware.js.
# Until DNS for that domain points at this project, set a 301 forward
# in Squarespace (Domains → Website → Domain Forwarding) to
# https://judecoffee.com with Permanent Redirect and Maintain paths.

